From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:18:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] twinapi.appcore: IInspectable answers, device information,
 app state registrations

GetIids / GetRuntimeClassName / GetTrustLevel answer for every object and
factory (EasClientDeviceInformation, AnalyticsInfo/VersionInfo, AdvertisingManager,
SystemIdentification and the privacy settings factories). EasClientDeviceInformation
reads Id (MachineGuid), OperatingSystem, FriendlyName (computer name) and the
SMBIOS system manufacturer/product/SKU; AnalyticsInfo.DeviceForm is "Desktop";
the Diagnostics/AssignedAccess settings carry a null User. Register/Unregister
AppStateChange and AppConstrainedChange notifications keep a registration
(the process is never suspended, so the routines are never called).
DllGetClassObject and DllCanUnloadNow answer. Test fix: the DeviceFamilyVersion
test read its UBR size from an uninitialised variable.

